# Project rules: Landing page

- Plain HTML and CSS unless I ask for a framework. No build step for v1.
- One page, one goal, one main call-to-action button. Ask before adding sections.
- Mobile first: check that the layout works at 375px wide before desktop.
- Use real text for headings (no text baked into images), alt text on every image, and visible focus styles.
- Signup forms post to the email provider's embed code. Don't write our own backend for signups.
- Keep images small (compressed, sized for display) and don't add tracking scripts unless I ask.
